  "$m = \\varphi\\rho_нV = ⟪0⟫ \\cdot 17{,}3 \\cdot ⟪1⟫ \\approx ⟪2⟫$ г.": "$m = \\varphi\\rho_қV = ⟪0⟫ \\cdot 17{,}3 \\cdot ⟪1⟫ \\approx ⟪2⟫$ г.",
