  "$r = \\sqrt{\\frac{kq_1q_2}{F}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{9 \\cdot 10^9 \\cdot ⟪0⟫ \\cdot ⟪1⟫}{⟪2⟫}} = ⟪3⟫$ м.": "$r = \\sqrt{\\frac{kq_1q_2}{F}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{9 \\cdot 10^9 \\cdot ⟪0⟫ \\cdot ⟪1⟫}{⟪2⟫}} = ⟪3⟫$ м.",
