  "$C = \\frac{\\varepsilon_0S}{d} = \\frac{8{,}85 \\cdot 10^{-12} \\cdot ⟪0⟫}{⟪1⟫} \\approx ⟪2⟫$ Ф.": "$C = \\frac{\\varepsilon_0S}{d} = \\frac{8{,}85 \\cdot 10^{-12} \\cdot ⟪0⟫}{⟪1⟫} \\approx ⟪2⟫$ Ф.",
